{
  "title": "ARIA — Amazon Bedrock",
  "uid": "aria-bedrock",
  "description": "Tokens et coûts pour le provider Bedrock (AI_PROVIDER=bedrock, actif par défaut — modèle courant : deepseek.v3.2, voir app/core/config.py::BEDROCK_MODEL). Fonctionne avec n'importe quel modèle Bedrock configuré, pas seulement Claude — les panels 'par modèle' se réajustent automatiquement si BEDROCK_MODEL change.",
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "tags": ["aria", "bedrock", "deepseek", "llm"],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "panels": [

    { "id": 100, "type": "row", "title": "📊 Résumé Bedrock", "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 1 } },

    {
      "id": 1, "title": "Tokens totaux (24h)", "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 1, "w": 8, "h": 4 },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "yellow", "value": 50000 },
            { "color": "red", "value": 500000 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum(increase(aria_llm_tokens_total{provider=\"bedrock\"}[24h]))",
        "legendFormat": "Tokens"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 2, "title": "Coût estimé (24h)", "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "x": 8, "y": 1, "w": 8, "h": 4 },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
            { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum(increase(aria_llm_cost_total{provider=\"bedrock\"}[24h]))",
        "legendFormat": "Coût USD"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 3, "title": "Tokens/min (actuel)", "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 1, "w": 8, "h": 4 },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "orange", "value": 5000 },
            { "color": "red", "value": 20000 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum(rate(aria_llm_tokens_total{provider=\"bedrock\"}[1m])) * 60",
        "legendFormat": "Tokens/min"
      }]
    },

    { "id": 200, "type": "row", "title": "📈 Consommation dans le temps", "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 24, "h": 1 } },

    {
      "id": 4, "title": "Tokens/min — par tâche", "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 6, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum by (task_name) (rate(aria_llm_tokens_total{provider=\"bedrock\"}[1m]) * 60)",
        "legendFormat": "{{task_name}}"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 5, "title": "Coût/heure — par modèle", "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 14, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 6,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum by (model_name) (rate(aria_llm_cost_total{provider=\"bedrock\"}[5m]) * 3600)",
        "legendFormat": "{{model_name}}"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 6, "title": "Répartition tokens par modèle", "type": "piechart",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 14, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "options": {
        "displayLabels": ["name", "percent"],
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum by (model_name) (aria_llm_tokens_total{provider=\"bedrock\"})",
        "legendFormat": "{{model_name}}"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 7, "title": "Répartition tokens par tâche", "type": "piechart",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 22, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "options": {
        "displayLabels": ["name", "percent"],
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "sum by (task_name) (aria_llm_tokens_total{provider=\"bedrock\"})",
        "legendFormat": "{{task_name}}"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "📋 Note — statut de la migration",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 22, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## ✅ Bedrock actif — provider par défaut\n\n**État actuel :**\n- `AI_PROVIDER=bedrock`, `BEDROCK_MODEL=deepseek.v3.2` (app/core/config.py, .env)\n- deepseek.v3.2 choisi après comparaison avec moonshotai.kimi-k2.5 sur le golden dataset param-detection (140 cas, `evaluation/run_scripts/run_param_detection_eval.py`)\n- `app/ai/bedrock_client.py` implémente `classify_api_call` + `structured_chat`, avec retry-once sur absence de tool call (deepseek consomme parfois des tokens de raisonnement avant l'appel d'outil — max_tokens par défaut relevé à 1500)\n- Tarification dans `app/llm_observability/pricing.py` (`deepseek.v3.2`, taux `default_estimated` — non vérifié sur une page de pricing Bedrock en direct)\n- Rollback vers Groq/Azure : changer `AI_PROVIDER` dans `.env`, aucun changement de code requis\n\nComparaison de coûts inter-modèles : `GET /llm/compare-models` ou `python -m scripts.compare_llm_models`"
      }
    }
  ]
}
